window.agHelp=()=>{const d=(t,l)=>'<details><summary>'+t+'</summary><ol>'+l.map(x=>'<li>'+x+'</li>').join('')+'</ol></details>';return '<h3 style="margin-top:16px">Agro-shop features</h3>'
 +d('A. Farmers (your customer book)',['Go to <b>Farmers → Farmers → + Add farmer</b>. Save the phone number, village, crops and group.','On <b>Sell</b>, start typing the farmer’s name: the list suggests registered farmers so credit and history stay together.','Tap a farmer to see what they bought, what they owe, advice given and produce offers. From there you can call, WhatsApp, record advice or sell.'])
 +d('B. Advice visits and soil tests (extension)',['<b>Farmers → Advice → + New advice visit</b>. Choose the farmer, type (farm visit, soil test, pest diagnosis, animal health…), crop, findings and advice.','Add the <b>recommended products</b>, then tap <b>Sell these products now</b> to put them in the cart, or <b>Advice slip</b> to print or send it on WhatsApp.','Set a <b>follow-up date</b>: Home reminds you. When you follow up, record the result.','If you charge a fee, tap <b>Charge the fee on Sell</b>. Fees are normal products in the <b>Services</b> category, so you can change them in Stock.'])
 +d('C. Training, field days and demo plots',['<b>Farmers → Events → + New</b>. Record topic, venue, attendance (women and youth), partner and cost.','Choose “Yes” to record the cost as an expense.','Use <b>Invite farmers by message</b> to send an invitation.','The monthly report counts events and people reached — useful for NGOs and the district office.'])
 +d('D. Messages to farmers',['<b>Farmers → Messages</b>. Pick a template or write your own; {name} and {shop} are filled in.','Choose who gets it (all, by crop, group, village, owing credit, inactive).','Tap <b>WhatsApp</b> or <b>SMS</b> beside each farmer. It opens the app with the message ready.'])
 +d('E. Market linkages: prices, supply, demand and deals',['<b>Market → Prices</b>: record prices you see in markets; <b>Share price board</b> sends them to farmers.','<b>Supply</b>: record what a farmer will sell (produce, quantity, asking price). <b>Demand</b>: record what a buyer wants.','<b>Match</b> shows supply and demand side by side for each produce. Tap one to create a deal.','<b>Deals</b>: record buying produce from a farmer, then <b>Deliver to a buyer</b> and <b>Buyer paid</b>. Margin, money owed to farmers and money owed by buyers are tracked, and the cash book includes these payments.','<b>Buy-back:</b> when buying produce from a farmer who owes input credit, type the <b>offset</b> amount. It reduces the farmer’s credit without cash changing hands.'])
 +d('F. Open a bag / repack loose',['Mark a product as <b>loose</b> in its details (opened from a bag product, with units per bag).','<b>Stock → Open a bag / repack loose</b> moves the bag into loose units, so you can sell by the kilo and stock stays right. Never repack agro-chemicals into unlabeled containers.'])
 +d('G. Expiry watch and safe-use notes',['Enter <b>batch number</b> and <b>expiry date</b> when recording stock arriving. Stock and Home show products nearing expiry.','In a product’s details add <b>active ingredient</b>, <b>days to wait before harvest</b> and a <b>safe-use note</b>. They print on the receipt under “How to use safely”. Agro-chemical and vet receipts always print safety reminders.'])
 +d('H. Guide, calendar, partners and licences',['<b>More → Crop & livestock guide</b> works offline: crop notes, livestock health, problem finder and safe-use rules.','<b>Season calendar</b> shows planting and harvest windows for your region (set it in Setup).','<b>Market → Partners</b> keeps contacts for the district officer, veterinarian, SACCO, insurer and others.','<b>More → Documents & licences</b> reminds you before a licence expires.'])
 +d('I. Trying it out',['<b>Setup → Load demo data</b> adds sample farmers, advice, events, offers, buyers and deals so you can practise. <b>Remove demo data</b> deletes only those samples.'])};

